"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids has November to December under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 36% of normal in November to December and 49% in August to September. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 37% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 19966 had its driest year in 1963 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
